# Build output; `cargo build` writes it again.
/target

# CLAUDE.md is a local copy of AGENTS.md, and AGENTS.md is the file this repository keeps.
CLAUDE.md

# Publish no file and no directory whose name starts with a dot, at any depth. A secret file
# (.env, .netrc, .npmrc) and a local tool directory stay out of the repository by default.
# The lines below name each dot file that the repository keeps. Nothing else is published.
.*
!.gitattributes
!.gitignore
!.githooks/
!.cargo/
!.config/
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json

# Private key material and keystores, whatever the file name says.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore

# Python bytecode from `uv run` dev tooling.
__pycache__/

# Compiler output that a `lumen build` writes beside a source file, wherever it writes it.
# The repository keeps the source; no class file is part of a test, and none is published.
*.class
*.jar
# The seed of the bootstrap is the one archive the repository keeps: `bin/bootstrap` starts from it.
!bin/seed.jar
*.jmod
*.jsa

# Crash and profile files that a JVM writes into the directory it runs in.
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log
*.hprof
